        "instruction": {
          "title": "Link the sky view to the orbit view",
          "description": "Study the line-of-sight relationship between Earth, Mars, and the background stars to see why the apparent direction reverses during overtaking. Learning objective: connect the observed night-sky loop to heliocentric geometry."
        },
